AutoStacc's own creator space (data/creators.js), at /autostacc: its profile page (../autostacc.html, generated) and each of its projects' pages at /autostacc/<project>: the hand-written home (<project>.html) and pages (<project>/), plus generated release and news pages (<project>/music/, <project>/news/; don't edit those, change data/ and rebuild). Studio creators have no folder: their pages live in the store database (server/sites/).
